{"id":"5193","groups":[{"type":"pnri","label":"相关图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/5193_main_altocumulus-stratiformis-undulatus-perlucidus-from-the-air_clouds.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc1\"><p>图为在意大利阿尔卑斯山上空约11000米高空的飞机上看到的一层<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">漏隙波状成层高积云</span>。在图片右下方，可看到山脉上空有一些<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">积云</span>。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© George Anderson","location":"意大利，特伦托省","latitude":"纬度: 45° 45' 17'' N","longitude":"经度: 10° 52' 13'' E","date":"02 September 2013 1749 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向北","cloudCode":"","code":"图像P/S代码: P.20.4.11","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.20.4.11"},{"src":"/images/original/syn/5193_syn_altocumulus-stratiformis-undulatus-perlucidus-from-the-air_clouds.gif","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc2\"><p>反气旋（1030 hPa）的中心就在英国西南方向，高压脊在阿尔卑斯山上空向东延伸。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 皇家版权","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/original/upper/5193_upper_altocumulus-stratiformis-undulatus-perlucidus-from-the-air_clouds.gif","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc3\"><p>从意大利乌迪内坎波福米奥进行的探测是在飞机位置的东东北方向约180公里。探测显示低层大气对白天增温稍不稳定（因此有积云），但在约570 hPa有逆温。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 怀俄明大学","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/compressed/sat/5193_sat_altocumulus-stratiformis-undulatus-perlucidus-from-the-air_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc4\"><p>反气旋的大部分均无云，但在阿尔卑斯山的东端则明显有云。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© EUMETSAT, 2013","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""}]}]}